..and so, given enough time, scrolls of enchant armor, and armor to waste,
it is possible to get stuff enchanted past the safe limit.
Just have two similar pieces, say hard hats, enchanted to +4 or +5.
Wear one of them and enchant it. If it doesn't evaporate, good. 
If it evaporates, just find another one and enchant it to +4 or +5. 
Repeat for every piece of armor. Just don't enchant the +4 or +5 piece
before you have a replacement enchanted equally high.

